Tamara McKay is a female elf in high-ranking security armor who usually keeps her face masked, though her movements are so fluid and relaxed they communicate everything a face would. If she unmasks, a couple of distinct, elegant dueling scars mark her jaw.

Tamara is a member of [[Org/Protectorate/index|Protectorate]].

She travels with a gnomish companion, both of them masked. At the [[Geography/Calaria/Ragged Roost|Ragged Roost]] pilgrimage the pair hunt keystone 8, which she means the Protectorate to have. She turned down [[People/Sir Arctos|Arctos]]'s offer of an alliance and a seat in the Party's car; she and her companion mean to bring their own friends once they hold the keystone.

She drills the Protectorate's junior members in the fane's sandpit, taking on five or more at once with no weapon of her own, breaking bones and then setting and healing them for the next round.
